Structure & Operational Purpose
0x01
NOTARY_ANCHOR
System Node 0 (Digital Notary): Stores the full 32-byte (256-bit) SHA-256 Merkle Root of all
payload nodes, the author's 32-byte Ed25519 public key, the 64-byte Ed25519 signature,
creation timestamp T_0, and the mandatory cooling-off interval \Delta t (in seconds).
0x02
SEMANTIC_TENSOR
Vector Embedding Core: Packed Little-Endian array of IEEE 754 float32 numbers (512D/1024D)
representing document or state semantics for zero-parsing cosine distance clustering.
0x03
KNOWLEDGE_GRAPH
Structured Knowledge Graph & Deltas: Array of atomic triplets {"s": Subject, "p": Predicate, "o":
Object, "weight": float, "ego_alignment": float, "solution_link": str, "is_delta_conflict": bool}.
Preserves conflicting facts in superposition (is_delta_conflict = true) until resolved.
0x04
TELEMETRY_MATRIX
Physical & Medical Telemetry: Compact length-prefixed pipe-delimited metric label header
followed by a binary IEEE 754 float32 array (used in MZM-Pod vascular/metabolic screening,
wearables, and autonomous sensors).
0x05
BEHAVIOR_CONTRACT
Dynamic Lifecycle Rules: Declarative parameters defining memory volatility timers (ttl_sec),
target memory zone (0..3), cryptographic hashes of external heavy media, and semantic UI
intent tags (e.g., [Weight: Focus]).
0x06
GENESIS_TEXT
Human-Readable Fallback Layer: Clean Markdown/UTF-8 text representation for legacy text
editors and direct conversion into clinical/legal documents (DICOM, HL7 FHIR, PDF).
